  "executive_briefing": "The crypto market is entering a phase of institutional consolidation and legislative finalization. The passage of the CLARITY Act in the House with strong bipartisan support (294-134) and its subsequent progression to the Senate Banking Committee represents a fundamental shift toward regulatory certainty. This legislative momentum is mirrored by the evolution of Bitcoin-based financial products, transitioning from simple spot ETFs to complex 'Bitcoin Bond' instruments and corporate treasury strategies aimed at maximizing 'Bitcoin per share.' Technically, the ecosystem is pivoting away from high-risk custodial bridges toward intent-based and atomic cross-chain liquidity models. While Ethereum remains the primary hub for enterprise decentralized applications, the focus on security-hardened smart contract environments is intensifying the competition between EVM-based flexibility and Bitcoin-native determinism.",
